------------------+---------------------------+-----------------------
         20971520 |                         0 |                     0
(1 row)

SELECT svs_memory_admit_database(521, 1::bigint);
ERROR:  admitting database 521 at 1 bytes would exceed svs.max_residency_memory
DETAIL:  Every admitted database's residency budget would sum to 104857601 bytes, over the 104857600 byte ceiling.
SELECT * FROM svs_memory_read_stats(521);
 residency_budget | residency_bytes_committed | build_bytes_committed 
------------------+---------------------------+-----------------------
(0 rows)

SELECT * FROM svs_memory_test_check_invariants();
 db_oid | violation 
